    {
      "source": "Inspects the given target type for methods with <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/annotation/Value.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.annotation\"><code>Value</code></a> annotations and caches the result.",
      "translation": "检查给定的目标类型，查找带有 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/annotation/Value.html\" title=\"org.springframework.beans.factory.annotation 中的类或接口\"><code>Value</code></a> 注解的方法，并缓存结果。",
