    {
      "source": "Registers the given <a href=\"MethodInterceptorFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.projection\"><code>MethodInterceptorFactory</code></a> to be used with the factory.",
      "translation": "注册给定的<a href=\"MethodInterceptorFactory.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.projection 中的接口\"><code>MethodInterceptorFactory</code></a>，以便与工厂一起使用。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Registers the given <a href=\"MethodInterceptorFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.projection\"><code>MethodInterceptorFactory</code></a> to be used with the factory. Factories registered later enjoy\nprecedence over previously registered ones.",
      "translation": "注册给定的<a href=\"MethodInterceptorFactory.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.projection 中的接口\"><code>MethodInterceptorFactory</code></a>以供工厂使用。后注册的工厂享有优先于先前注册的工厂的优先级。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
